# Security response headers for static hosting (Cloudflare Pages / Netlify
# `_headers` format; adapter-static copies this file into the build root).
#
# These complement the CSP injected by SvelteKit (kit.csp, hash mode). The
# directives below MUST be delivered as real HTTP headers — a <meta> CSP cannot
# enforce frame-ancestors or form-action. For nginx/Caddy/other hosts, set the
# equivalent headers in the server config.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'; form-action 'self'; base-uri 'self'
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()
